{title: Gloria al rey santo y justo}
{key: C}
{meta: category Alabanza}

{start_of_verse}
[C]Gloria al Rey, Rey [F]santo y [C]justo,
[F]Gloria al [C]Maestro, en su [F]trono en [G]Sión.[G7]
[C]Digno Maestro, [F]digno de [C]alabanzas,
[F]santo, [C]santo, [F]gloria [G]y honra a [C]Ti[A7]
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Sube un tono (Re mayor)}
{start_of_verse}
[D]Gloria al Rey, Rey [G]santo y [D]justo,
[G]Gloria al [D]Maestro, en su [G]trono en [A]Sión.[A7]
[D]Digno Maestro, [G]digno de [D]alabanzas,
[G]santo, [D]santo, [G]gloria [A]y honra a [D]Ti[B7]
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Sube otro tono (Mi mayor)}
{start_of_verse}
[E]Gloria al Rey, Rey [A]santo y [E]justo,
[A]Gloria al [E]Maestro, en su [A]trono en [B7]Sión.
[E]Digno Maestro, [A]digno de [E]alabanzas,
[A]santo, [E]santo, [A]gloria [B7]y honra a [E]Ti
{end_of_verse}
